{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_034100","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"你们把那架巨型直升机叫作“Hombre Nuevo”吧……","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":63,"review_flag":"JPN_SPANISH_NICKNAME_PRESERVED"},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"嗯。“Hombre Nuevo”就是“新人类”的意思。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":57,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"“新人类”？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":18,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"那架直升机上没有人。大概是机器在操纵。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":57,"review_flag":"JPN_PROBABILITY_PRIMARY"},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"看来是这样。正因为如此，才能做出那种乱来的机动。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":72,"review_flag":"AUX_NO_HUMAN_CLAIM_REPLACED_BY_JPN_CAUSALITY"},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"可即便如此，它的动作也很聪明。还会唱歌。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":60,"review_flag":"JPN_INTELLIGENT_MOVEMENT_PRIMARY"},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"看到它以后，队里有人就说“里面坐着<R=新人类,Hombre Nuevo>”。","cn_control_tokens":"<R=新人类,Hombre Nuevo>","cn_utf8_bytes":83,"review_flag":"RUBY_LOCALIZED_SPANISH_READING"},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"不过，我不喜欢这个叫法。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":36,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"为什么？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":12,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"因为“<R=新人类,Hombre Nuevo>”是格瓦拉追求的理想，也是聚集到<R=FSLN,Sandinista>的人们追求的目标。","cn_control_tokens":"<R=新人类,Hombre Nuevo> <R=FSLN,Sandinista>","cn_utf8_bytes":129,"review_flag":"RUBY_LOCALIZED_LATIN_READINGS;JPN_IDEAL_PRIMARY"},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"在道德和自发劳动中找到喜悦的“新人类”……把这个名字送给那种怪物，我实在不甘心。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":120,"review_flag":"JPN_FRUSTRATION_NUANCE_PRIMARY"},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"确实。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":9,"review_flag":"AUX_BET_PARAPHRASE_REPLACED_BY_JPN"}]}